lt;b&gt;API SIGA (backend/)&lt;/b&gt;' style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="i1-rnode"><mxGeometry x="15" y="70" width="290" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-rstart" value='&lt;font color="#666666" style="font-size:9px"&gt;«artifact»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;start: python -m app.seed &amp;&amp; uvicorn …&lt;/b&gt;' style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="i1-rnode"><mxGeometry x="15" y="127" width="290" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-rcfg" value='&lt;font color="#666666" style="font-size:9px"&gt;«artifact»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DATABASE_URL, SMTP_*, FRONTEND_URL,&lt;br&gt;COOKIE_SEGURO=1&lt;/b&gt;' style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="i1-rnode"><mxGeometry x="15" y="184" width="290" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-rpdf" value='&lt;font color="#666666" style="font-size:9px"&gt;«artifact»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;gerador de PDF (RBN09.14 a 09.17)&lt;/b&gt;' style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="i1-rnode"><mxGeometry x="15" y="246" width="290" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-neon" value='&lt;font color="#555555" style="font-size:9px"&gt;«device» «cloud»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Neon ou Supabase (plano grátis)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:9.5px"&gt;Supabase: usar o Session pooler (IPv4)&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=cube;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=18;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=8;container=1;collapsible=0;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="90" width="330" height="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-pg" value='&lt;font color="#555555" style="font-size:9px"&gt;«executionEnvironment»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PostgreSQL 16 gerenciado&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:9.5px"&gt;conexão com TLS&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=cube;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=18;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=8;container=1;collapsible=0;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="i1-neon"><mxGeometry x="20" y="75" width="290" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-pbanco" value='&lt;font color="#666666" style="font-size:9px"&gt;«artifact»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;banco siga&lt;/b&gt;' style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=10;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="i1-pg"><mxGeometry x="15" y="70" width="260" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-stor" value='&lt;font color="#555555" style="font-size:9px"&gt;«device»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Armazenamento de arquivos&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:9.5px"&gt;Supabase Storage ou similar · PDFs do&lt;br&gt;TCC, ata e certificados (RAN07)&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=cube;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=18;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=8;container=1;collapsible=0;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="400" width="330" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-smtp" value='&lt;font color="#555555" style="font-size:9px"&gt;«device»&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Servidor de e-mail&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:9.5px"&gt;smtp.gmail.com :587 · se o Render bloquear SMTP,&lt;br&gt;trocar por Brevo ou Resend (API HTTPS)&lt;/font&gt;' style="shape=cube;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=18;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=8;container=1;collapsible=0;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="620" width="330" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-nota" value="&lt;b&gt;Notas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Ambiente para homologação e apresentação (HT06), sem custo e sem cartão.&lt;br&gt;• Não cumpre o RNF07 (99%): a API dorme. Abrir o sistema alguns minutos antes de apresentar.&lt;br&gt;• Tarefas agendadas (lembretes, revogação) precisam de um agendador: Render Cron Job ou GitHub Actions agendado.&lt;br&gt;• O cookie de sessão fica na mesma origem: o navegador só fala com a Vercel, que repassa /api/v1." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=10.5;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#b7a63a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="800" width="800" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-e0" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5455;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.4828;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;endArrow=none;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="i1-cli" target="i1-vercel"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-e0-l" value="HTTPS · :443" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];fontSize=10;fontColor=#222222;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="i1-e0"><mxGeometry x="0.0000" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-13" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="i1-e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.4500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.3107;entryDx=0;entr